                    <h2 class="sub">                    Detachable-Capsule Condenser Microphone</h2>
                    <p>The Global Pre is a transformerless FET condenser preamp circuit host for bayonet-style interchangeable capsules supplied by Neumann/Gefell (the M7, M8, M9), Blue&#8217;s &#8220;B&#8221; series aka the Bottle Caps, and Violet&#8217;s own VIN series.</p><p>The Global Pre does not include any capsules; buyers can pick from any of the available &#8220;VIN&#8221; models, or use 3rd-party capsules. </p><p><a href="//cdn.recordinghacks.com/images/mic_extras/violet/global_pre_mount.jpg" rel="shadowbox"><img src="//cdn.recordinghacks.com/images/mic_extras/violet/global_pre_mount_sm.jpg" width="200" class="thumb shaft" /></a>It ships with a shockmount (Violet p/n GSM) in a padded wooden box.</p><p>Like all Violet&#8217;s products, it is handmade in Latvia (or possibly Estonia) and carries a 5-year warranty.<p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/Violet/Global-Pre">Violet Design Ltd. Global-Pre</a></p>
